[{"_1":2},"routes/docs-slug",{"_3":4},"data",{"_5":6,"_7":8},"content","# Narrative Intelligence\n\nNarrative Intelligence is the superpower of Novellis. It transforms your project from a document into a structured narrative database that **adapts as you write**.\n\n## The ArcView & Narrative Matrix\nThe primary interface for this intelligence is the **ArcView**. It provides a \"God view\" of your story's structure.\n\n### 1. The Matrix (Gantt Perspective)\nVisualize your story arcs as horizontal tracks across your chapters.\n- **Pacing Analysis**: See where your story is \"crowded\" with too many arcs and where it might be dragging.\n- **POV Lenses**: Filter the matrix to see only the chapters where a specific character appears, ensuring their journey is consistent and well-paced.\n\n### 2. Arc Builder\nThe AI can assist in building these structures:\n- **Auto-Discovery**: Let the AI analyze your draft to identify subplots you might have started subconsciously.\n- **Temporal Alignment**: Ensure that events in different arcs aren't happening at contradictory times.\n\n### 3. Event Drill-Down\nClick any event in the matrix to see:\n- A detailed description of the event.\n- The entities involved.\n- The specific chapter where it occurs.\n- A direct link to jump into the editor at that exact moment.\n\n## Why it matters\nTraditional outlining is rigid and static. Narrative Intelligence is fluid and **adaptive**. It doesn't require a finished plan; it provides precision based on whatever content is available, allowing your structure to evolve naturally as your story comes to life.\n","slug","intelligence"]
